                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "••• I made a small video review on youtube. Check it out! •••\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/vila4480/videos\n-This game is simple and fun. Although extremely limited (remember it still is an alpha), it is still fun to play with friends. \n\nHowever, the game mechanics are a bit too basic. Controls are simple, the graphics aren't amazing (although I chose the 'EPIC' setting for graphics quality!), the background sound is almost non-existant and I barely saw 1 server up and running. \nThis is a game to play with friends - and depending on who's with you, it may become really boring if they don't move often.\n\nI would suggest that the disguised characters would earn points for reaching certain spots in the map (this would keep them on the move). They should also move more slowly.\n\nHaving said that I think the pricetag of 15€ is waaay way high. This should be sold at 3-5€ or as a multiple game pack so you're able to convince your friends to buy and play with you. Don't starve together only sells multiple copies for instance (you get one free)... which makes sense!\n\nI'm more into a intelligently designed games, but this one can be fun with friends.",
